  "notes": "## 0.14.0-alpha.9 - 2026-06-08\n\n### Features\n\n- Add a compact update dialog with options to skip a version, be reminded later, install the update, and toggle future automatic downloads (#992)\n- Apply network setting changes by restarting the background service while keeping the app window open, with clearer progress and success feedback (#994)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix VPS Docker deployments so the headless server can start instead of crash-looping (#986)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.14.0-alpha.9 - 2026-06-08\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增更紧凑的更新对话框，可跳过某个版本、稍后提醒、安装更新，并可直接切换今后是否自动下载更新 (#992)\n- 网络设置变更现在会重启后台服务来生效，同时保持应用窗口打开，并提供更清晰的进度和成功反馈 (#994)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复 VPS Docker 部署中无界面服务无法启动、容器反复崩溃的问题 (#986)",
